 amazing what suvs can do says klaus  it's just a shame that most people who  drive them never get to really  experience them off road  the steep slopes you might get stuck but  the tourx electronics  automatically prevent the suv from  rolling backwards  but if the green terrain light is  flashing that means the suv  has detected a downward slope and will  engage the brakes  you might need a little bit of courage  to take your foot off the brake  but the system works  and now on to the next stage  the touareg is also at home on the  street the eight-speed automatic shifts  smoothly in all driving conditions and  the new transmission is also more fuel  efficient  when the driver takes their foot off the  gas the engine is decoupled from the  drivetrain  and starts idling that helps save fuel  the turret gets on just fine on regular  roads it's a sporty comfortable suv that  boasts really good handling at high  speeds  outside of the city it's a safe and good  all-around  suv thanks to its all-wheel drive  the tour egg drives like a big station  wagon that's built for long distance  trips  but the tour egg isn't cheap our test  model sticker price is just under 58 000  euros  the new tourig is really an improvement  says klaus it offers sound handling on  the street and great performance  off-road  that's why it's one of the best in its  class  you
 

